      "message": "With Legacy power sequence `slp_sus` check is made is G3S5. If this signal is not de-asserted, we move into S5G3, and `AP_POWER_HARD_OFF` is generated on S5G3 state.\n\nWith new power sequence `slp_sus` signal error is detected while remaining on G3 and `AP_POWER_HARD_OFF` event is only generated whenever entering into G3.",
